  \node[draw=ChapterStone,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=5.2cm,minimum height=1.8cm,font=\small,align=center] (a) at (-3.2,3.2) {1:5, 1:7 \ 省察你們的行為\\ \textit{Consider your ways}\\ 看過去的帳 \ ×2};
  \node[draw=ChapterStone,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=5.2cm,minimum height=1.8cm,font=\small,align=center] (b) at (3.2,3.2) {2:15, 2:18 \ 從今日起\\ \textit{Consider from this day}\\ 看那一天 \ ×3};
  \draw[->,color=ScriptureGold,thick] (a) -- (b);

  \node[draw=ScriptureGold,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=3.2cm,minimum height=1.3cm,font=\small,align=center] (m1) at (-4.6,0.6) {2:9 \ 賜平安\\ \textit{I will give peace}};
  \node[draw=ScriptureGold,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=3.2cm,minimum height=1.3cm,font=\small,align=center] (m2) at (0,0.6) {2:19 \ 賜福\\ \textit{I will bless}};
  \node[draw=ScriptureGold,fill=ScriptureBg,rounded corners,minimum width=3.2cm,minimum height=1.3cm,font=\small,align=center] (m3) at (4.6,0.6) {2:23 \ 揀選\\ \textit{I have chosen}};
  \node[draw=ChapterStone,fill=white,rounded corners,minimum width=9.6cm,minimum height=0.9cm,font=\small\bfseries,text=ChapterStone,align=center] at (0,-1.4) {2:23 \ 因我揀選了你 \ \textit{for I have chosen you}};
  \draw[->,color=ScriptureGold,thick] (m1) -- (-4.6,-0.95);
  \draw[->,color=ScriptureGold,thick] (m2) -- (0,-0.95);
  \draw[->,color=ScriptureGold,thick] (m3) -- (4.6,-0.95);
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.8cm}

\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
動詞「放」（שׂים）在三十八節裏七次：前六次是人把心放在自己的道路上、把石頭壘上去；最後一次是神把一個人放成自己的印。三個後半的信息，各以神自己的動詞收尾：我必賜平安、我必賜福、我揀選了。書的最後一句，不是一個命令，是一個已經完成的動詞。
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.5cm}
{\footnotesize\color{LightGray} 「到那日，我必以你為印，因我揀選了你。」— 哈該書 2:23}
\end{center}
