\begin{center}
{\Large\itshape\color{CoverGoldBright} כִּי בְךָ בָחַרְתִּי}\\[0.1cm]
{\itshape\small\color{CoverMuted} {\baskervillefont "For I have chosen you"} · 全書最後一節的主句 (2:23)}

\vspace{0.4cm}

\fleuron[CoverGoldBright]\hspace{0.25cm}{\color{CoverGoldBright}\rule{1.8in}{0.4pt}}\hspace{0.25cm}\fleuron[CoverGoldBright]

\vspace{0.4cm}

{\large\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 關於本書}\qquad{\baskervillefont\itshape\large\color{CoverGoldBright} About This Book}

\vspace{0.4cm}

\begin{minipage}{5in}
\small\color{CoverCream}
哈該書只有兩章三十八節，卻數得出一個骨架動詞：「放」七次。全書第一個命令，是人把心放在自己的道路上（「你們要省察自己的行為」）；最後一個應許，是神把一個人放成自己的印（「我必以你為印」）。百姓說「時候未到」，神不爭論時間表：祂先翻開他們的帳，然後說「我與你們同在」，在收成還看不見的時候說「從今日起，我必賜福」，最後說「因我揀選了你」。本書分五步逐節研讀全卷，以「啟示的次序」為骨幹，整合老弟兄的查經方法、加爾文與亨利的歷代注疏，以及 G. Campbell Morgan 的解經。每一句歸給注疏家的引文都附英文原文與出處，可以按圖索驥核對。

\vspace{0.3cm}

{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream}\lettrine[lines=3,findent=2pt,nindent=2pt]{\color{CoverGoldBright}H}{}aggai has two chapters and thirty-eight verses, yet one verb runs through them: “set” (seven times). The first command of the book is that the people set their hearts on their ways; the last promise is that God will set one man like a signet ring. The people say, “The time has not come”; the LORD does not argue the timetable. He opens their ledger, says “I am with you,” and—while no fruit is yet in sight—“From this day on I will bless you,” and at the last, “I have chosen you.” This study reads the whole book in five movements, built on the order of revelation, with Elder Wong's way of reading Scripture and the commentary of Calvin, Henry, and Morgan. Every quotation attributed to a commentator is given in its original English with a checkable source.}
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.4cm}

{\small\bfseries\color{CoverCream} 五步：從帳目到揀選}\qquad{\baskervillefont\itshape\small\color{CoverGoldBright} Five Movements}

\vspace{0.3cm}

\begin{minipage}{4.7in}
\small\color{CoverCream}
\begin{tabular}{@{}cp{3.4in}l@{}}
第一步 & 先翻開帳本 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} Consider your ways} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 1:1-11}\\[0.25em]
第二步 & 先同在，後作工 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} I am with you} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 1:12-15}\\[0.25em]
第三步 & 用同在回答比較 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} Does it not seem like nothing?} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 2:1-9}\\[0.25em]
第四步 & 祝福在收成之前 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} From this day on} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 2:10-19}\\[0.25em]
第五步 & 最後一句是揀選 \textit{\baskervillefont\color{CoverCream} I will make you like a signet} & {\tiny\color{CoverMuted} 2:20-23}\\
\end{tabular}
\end{minipage}

\vspace{0.4cm}

